        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"max-width:580px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;\"><div style=\"background:#000;padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:3px solid #00b8db;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0;color:#00b8db;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">Gadgetlesstech Ranking System&#8482;</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-1px;\">SEO4GEO</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:32px 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\"><p>Hey {{ $json.name || 'there' }},</p><p>Most people find Gadgetlesstech through the theory. You found it through the proof &#8212; and that tells me you are serious about understanding where your rankings actually stand.</p><p>SEO4GEO is the tool that makes keyword gaps impossible to ignore. But it is one piece of a larger system. Over the next few weeks I will show you the full picture:</p><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:16px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">01 &#8212;</span> <strong>Your SEO4GEO audit</strong> &#8212; what the data is telling you</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">02 &#8212;</span> <strong>Why the gap exists</strong> &#8212; the Query Expansion System explained</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">03 &#8212;</span> <strong>How to close it</strong> &#8212; the 4-layer Ranking System</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-siz