        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "The fastest way to start closing your keyword gaps",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"max-width:580px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;\"><div style=\"background:#000;padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:3px solid #00b8db;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0;color:#00b8db;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">The Action Plan</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-1px;\">SEO4GEO</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:32px 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\"><p>Hey {{ $json.name || 'there' }},</p><p>Your SEO4GEO audit gives you an AI-generated action plan. Here is how to prioritize it.</p><p><strong>Start with Layer 04 &#8212; Query Expansion.</strong> This is where most businesses have the largest gaps and the fastest wins. You are not competing on these searches at all, which means even modest content improvements will produce visible ranking movement.</p><p>Then move to <strong>Layer 02 &#8212; Topical Authority.</strong> This is the long game. Google and AI search engines reward businesses that comprehensively cover a subject area. Each piece of content you add compounds the authority signal.</p><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:20px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-size:16px;\">&#8594;</span> Run your audit and export the keyword gap report</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-size:16px;\">&#8594;</span> Identify the top 10 queries your competitor ranks for that you do not</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-size:16px;\">&#8594;</span> Create one page that directly addresses each cluster of those queries</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-size:16px;\">&#8594;</span> Repeat monthly &#8212; the compounding effect builds fast</td></tr></table><p>If this sounds like a lot to manage alone, that is what the next email is about.</p><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#00b8db;border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"https://seo4geo.com/audit\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">Get My Full Action Plan &#8594;</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;\">&#8212; Kevin<br><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:13px;\">Gadgetlesstech</span></p><hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #eee;margin:28px 0;\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;\">You received this because you signed up via SEO4GEO or the Gadgetlesstech Blueprint. <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#00b8db;\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></div></body></html>"
